{
  "name": "Burning Infusion",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you damage a creature with your kinetic shape, you can force it to make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your save DC. On a failure, the target is set ablaze, burning for fire damage equal to double your Proficiency modifier at the start of each of its turns.</p><p>It can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success. Alternatively, it or another creature can use an Action to douse the flames.</p>",
